.TH AURORA-TERMINAL 1 "2026-09-23" "Chimera II OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
aurora-terminal \- UTF-8 and Unicode terminal policy
.SH DESCRIPTION
Aurora terminals use UTF-8 input and output, preserve Unicode byte sequences, support right-to-left and left-to-right text, combining marks, variation selectors and emoji, and expose Chimera emoji aliases.
